# Purpose: Keep the required models/ folder present in source control.
# Interview Explanation: "The pretrained model is a separately downloaded
# deployment asset; this marker documents its expected location."
# Key Concepts: Git does not track empty directories.
# Important Things to Remember: Copy both MobileNetSSD model files here.
# Dependencies: None.
# Why This File Exists: Git needs a file to preserve an otherwise empty folder.
# Depends On: Git. Depended On By: developers placing model files here.
# Source: Standard Git .gitkeep convention.

# INTERVIEW NOTES: .gitkeep is not loaded by Python; it only documents layout...
   
